    ('Nose: a hotel room key that no longer works. Palate: magnetic strip confusion, mild panic, and the long walk back to the front desk. Finish: resolved but exhausting.', 1),
    ('On the nose: a 404 error page with a friendly illustration. Palate: broken links, digital sympathy, and the small cruelty of a cute cartoon saying "oops." Finish: goes nowhere.', 1),
