    ('Nose: a paper straw that lasted six seconds. Palate: cardboard dissolution, the ambition of environmental good faith, and a drink that is now mostly straw. Finish: structural failure; medium regret.', 1),
    ('On the nose: a "smart" home device that mishears everything. Palate: ambient surveillance, faint jazz from a misunderstood command, and a shipping notification you didn''t authorize. Finish: long and quietly unsettling.', 1),
