    ('Nose: warm spice, dark cherry, and subtle smoke from the char. Palate: opens beautifully with vanilla and fruit, then narrows into a very specific note of boiled cabbage that hangs around like an uninvited guest. Finish: sulfurous in the most hospitable way possible.', 2),
    ('On the nose: toasted corn and sweet grain, green apple in the background. Palate: the entry promises much, delivering caramel and cream, before landing on a mid-palate of rubber gasket and a finish of WD-40, applied lightly. Finish: mechanical; interestingly long.', 2),
    ('Nose: dried lavender, candied orange peel, and a dusty old library. Palate: an elegant floral entry gives way to dark fruit and spice, then closes on something undeniably reminiscent of a freshly opened bag of cat food. Finish: protein-forward; dry.', 2),
    ('On the nose: creamy vanilla with underlying sweetness and light oak influence. Palate: gentle and round, with caramel and dried fruit, until the finish introduces a bracing note of raw onion and a hint of gym sock. Finish: athletic, persistent.', 2),
