    ('On the nose: rich dark cherry and cinnamon with underlying grain sweetness. Palate: opens with dark fruit and chocolate, then the finish introduces a crisp note of aluminum foil and the mineral suggestion of chewing on a key. Finish: metallic; longer than you want.', 2),
